        <mxCell id="iWZVFv5La4RXQlfdSOgQ-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;DoMS&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Is an Open Source AI-Driven LMS. Intent to make the learner manages his learning path and collecting courses into one unified, general, AI-Driven, and clean platform.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
